    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Basada en el cuento hom\u00f3nimo de Miguel Barnet, cuenta la historia de Manuel Garc\u00eda, apodado Manolito, nacido en la provincia y emigrado a la capital, a quien siendo ni\u00f1o se le apareci\u00f3 la Virgen de F\u00e1tima. Ya en La Habana conoce y se enamora del Vaselina, quien le alenta a travestirse y a comenzar una nueva vida en el mundo del espect\u00e1culo y la prostituci\u00f3n.",
        "english": "Fiction film based on the homonymous short story by Miguel Barnet, which tells the story of Fatima, the Queen of the night. The film tells the life of a young homosexual and transvestite, who prostitute to earn a living, and also to maintain economically to the man whom he loves, and who must face all the complexities arising from its decisions."
